# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This project lives in iCloud Drive, and sync
# leaves duplicates named "layout 2.tsx" beside the real file — 29 of them at
# the last count. They are never source, and one of them landing in the repo
# would be a second copy of a component quietly drifting from the first.
#
# The space before the digit is what makes this safe: it matches iCloud's
# naming and not a legitimate "duna61.ts" or "phase2.ts".
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
